          %h2#Properties Properties
          %h3#SplittingLemma Splitting lemma
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/splitting+lemma"} splitting lemma
            says that every
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/short+exact+sequence"} short exact sequence
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vector+spaces"} vector spaces
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/split+exact+sequence"} splits
            so that (in
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/categorification"} categorification
            of the
            = succeed ")" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/rank-nullity+theorem"} rank-nullity theorem
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
