          %h3#FiberCoProducts Fiber (co)products
          %p
            The
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cartesian+product"} cartesian product
            in
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
