            given by
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/direct+sum+of+vector+spaces"} direct sum of vector spaces
          %p
            More generally, the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber+product"} fiber product
            of a
