          %p
            In summary this means that the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/internal+logic"} internal logic
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/slice+category"} slices
            of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mi FinDimVect
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} FinDimVect
            is a
            = succeed "." do
              %a{:href => "quantum+logic#BirkhoffVonNeumannQuantumLogic"} Birkhoff-vonNeumann quantum logic
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Vect"} Vect
            %li
